--- Testing operational CLI command dispatchers & boundaries ---
==========================================================================
  Project Aesir CLI — verified local GGUF run + development surfaces
==========================================================================
Usage:
  aesir [command] [flags]

Implemented:
  home [--model-store path] — interactive launcher; plain aesir opens it in a terminal
  keygen <new-private-file> — create an OS-random service key without overwriting
  hardware list — observed CPU/CUDA devices and backend availability
  bench [--settle N] [--rounds N] [--pass prompt|reply|draft-check]
      Sweep the configurations the placement engine may choose
      (threads x devices x pass kinds) and print the machine report.
  compute plan|explain <model> [--profile auto|gemma4|llama3|qwen3]
      [--context N] [--device auto|N] [--reserve-mib N] [--model-store path]
  pull <owner/repo> <filename.gguf> --revision <commit-sha>
      --sha256 <digest> --size <bytes> [--output <path>] [--connections 1..8]
      [--name <name[:tag]> [--config <path>]]
