      CPU GGUF or auto-detected native CUDA Gemma4/Llama3/Qwen3 single-shot inference.
  run --accel hailo10h --model-path <model.hef> <prompt...>
      Hailo-10H direct in-process HailoRT GenAI single-shot inference.
